This repository houses the source code and configuration files for RSU1, the primary Road Side Unit in a multi-RSU VANET (Vehicular Ad-Hoc Networks) / V2X deployment architecture. RSU1 acts as a localized edge communication node responsible for broadcasting safety beacons, collecting telemetry data from passing vehicles, and routing information via backhaul to the central server or neighboring RSUs (RSU2 and RSU3).
